<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>TreeBench ablations on Qwen2.5-VL-7B. Best performances are highlighted in <span id="S3.T3.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>. The supervisor provides a stable boost and the visual decider adds the remaining lift; both components are necessary and complementary.</figcaption>
