<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S3.T4.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 4</span>: </span><span id="S3.T4.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Results on RH-Bench. Reas. indicates <span id="S3.T4.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Reasoning</span>, and Perc. indicates <span id="S3.T4.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Perception</span>. Best performances are highlighted in <span id="S3.T4.8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>. ECRD improves both Reasoning and Perception while increasing RH-AUC, indicating a better balance between reasoning and hallucination over longer chains.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
